ol.","/docs/pr-preview/pr-61/es/deployment/overview",{"_79":379},"deployment/overview.mdx",{"_54":381,"_61":100,"_75":-7,"_56":382},"es:_7","Kubernetes autogestionado",{"_54":384,"_61":72,"_56":385,"_66":386,"_75":-7,"_11":387,"_77":388},"es:deployment/self-hosted/overview.mdx","Kubernetes self-managed","Elige un flujo de instalación y una arquitectura de red para Lamassu en tu clúster Kubernetes.","/docs/pr-preview/pr-61/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview",{"_79":389},"deployment/self-hosted/overview.mdx",{"_54":391,"_61":72,"_56":392,"_66":393,"_75":-7,"_11":394,"_77":395},"es:deployment/self-hosted/helm.mdx","Instala con Helm","Prepara las dependencias, configura el chart de Lamassu y verifica un despliegue controlado en Kubernetes.","/docs/pr-preview/pr-61/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm",{"_79":396},"deployment/self-hosted/helm.mdx",{"_54":398,"_61":72,"_56":399,"_66":400,"_75":-7,"_11":401,"_77":402},"es:deployment/self-hosted/networking.mdx","Expón el Gateway","Elige cómo llegan los clientes a Lamassu, cuándo definir gateway.addresses y cómo diseñar varios Gateways.","/docs/pr-preview/pr-61/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking",{"_79":403},"deployment/self-hosted/networking.mdx",{"_54":405,"_61":72,"_56":406,"_66":407,"_75":-7,"_11":408,"_77":409},"es:deployment/self-hosted/fastlane.mdx","Fastlane","Arranca un entorno completo de evaluación o laboratorio de Lamassu en un clúster Kubernetes existente.","/docs/pr-preview/pr-61/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane",{"_79":410},"deployment/self-hosted/fastlane.mdx",{"_54":412,"_61":100,"_75":-7,"_56":413},"es:_8","Operación",{"_54":415,"_61":72,"_56":416,"_66":417,"_75":-7,"_11":418,"_77":419},"es:deployment/troubleshooting.mdx","Resolución de problemas de despliegue","Diagnostica acceso, salud de los servicios y dependencias de infraestructura.","/docs/pr-preview/pr-61/es/deployment/troubleshooting",{"_79":420},"deployment/troubleshooting.mdx",{"_54":422,"_61":100,"_75":-7,"_56":423},"es:_9","Otros modelos",{"_54":